HaishinKit RTC includes libdatachannel 0.24.8 (MPL-2.0) and its pinned
libjuice (MPL-2.0), libsrtp (BSD-3-Clause), usrsctp (BSD-3-Clause),
plog (MIT), nlohmann/json (MIT), and Mbed TLS 3.6.8 (Apache-2.0) dependencies.
License texts are included in this directory.

Upstream libdatachannel source and dependency revisions:
https://github.com/paullouisageneau/libdatachannel/tree/6c50b6d88fd691957f1d7df0d80875e9cd57606b
https://github.com/paullouisageneau/libdatachannel/blob/6c50b6d88fd691957f1d7df0d80875e9cd57606b/.gitmodules
Mbed TLS source:
https://github.com/Mbed-TLS/mbedtls/releases/tag/mbedtls-3.6.8
